# Template for git-filter-repo / BFG replacements.
# DO NOT commit actual secret values into this repo.
# Fill the right-hand side in your local copy before running git-filter-repo or BFG.
# Example format for git-filter-repo --replace-text (each line either "literal" or "old==>new"):
#
# Replace exact string occurrences (example):
# sk-OLDKEYEXAMPLE==>REDACTED_OPENAI_KEY
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY_OLD==>REDACTED_SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
#
# Save this file locally as `replacements.txt` (with real secret values filled in),
# then run:
#   git clone --mirror <repo-url> repo.git
#   cd repo.git
#   git filter-repo --replace-text ../replacements.txt
#   git push --force
